OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo batters Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of homes across
OL,7,FScotland remain without power in the
OL,8,Faftermath of Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FA 60-year-old man died in Dumfries and
OL,11,FGalloway as the second named storm in a
OL,12,Fmatter of days brought heavy flooding
OL,13,Fand wind gusts in some areas of up to
OL,14,F85mph (137km/h).
OL,16,FDespite widespread travel disruption
OL,17,Facross the weekend Network Rail said
OL,18,Fmost services had been restored to full
OL,19,Foperation after an amber weather
OL,20,Fwarning ended at 21:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
